em>[数据删除]</em>特定结构形态，在该实体崩解后受其影响有：<br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>受影响物</th> <th>保护措施</th> <th>影响表现</th> </tr> <tr> <td>SCP-CN-1589项目档案</td> <td>保留处理后的原档案，并对对更新档案进行模因保护</td> <td>更新档案内容会出现SCP-CN-1589相同特性</td> </tr> <tr> <td>人民路咖啡馆</td> <td>已进行封锁并伪装为居民楼</td> <td>咖啡馆内连续出现SCP-CN-1589残骸</td> </tr> <tr> <td>███殡仪馆</td> <td>已停用███号至███号冰柜，若异常未造成危害不作其他处理</td> <td>相关冰柜内随机出现█医生与一女性遗体，约3分钟后消失</td> </tr> </table> <p><span style="color: gray"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-CN-1589可收容在我们的回忆中。</span></span></p> <p><span style="color: gray"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-CN-1589可锁在我们的脑海。</span></span></p> <p><span style="color: gray"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">我们的脑海表现为SCP-CN-1589。</span></span></p> <p><span style="color: gray"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">人性尚存，SCP-CN-1589藐视一切物理伤害。</span></span></p> <p>SCP-CN-1589已销毁。</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-sunflowers" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6269695&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608622777" alt="the sunflowers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6269695)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-sunflowers" >the sunflowers</a></span></p> 
